          "value": "<p><em>Pond Patrol specialisations: Containment, Apprehension, Protection. Equipment: Standard arms, Patrol gear, Restraint equipment.</em></p><p><strong>Apprehension.</strong> Warran T carries restraint equipment: a creature Warran T has grappled can be bound as an action (escape DC 12 Strength or Dexterity check). <strong>Containment.</strong> A creature that starts its turn grappled by Warran T cannot use the Disengage action. <strong>Protection.</strong> Warran T can use the Help action to grant an adjacent ally +2 AC against the next attack before Warran T's next turn.</p>",
